g/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2608278/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤ちゃんずー、これからもよろしくね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばこれ新曲の衣装です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2608278/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私七夕のときに、去年「もっとキラキラ輝けますように」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったから今年は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「もっとギラギラ光れますように」ってお願いしたんですけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう叶っちゃいました(￣∀￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの間の乃木どこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで浴衣着ました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/erika.ikuta/%E3%81%84%E3%81%8F%E3%81%9F%EF%BC%92.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい浴衣着れてうれしかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2608278/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何枚か撮ったのでまた今度載せますね(^^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は夏祭り行けるかなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはもう行きましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日から私は田舎に旅行ってきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からの土曜日、大阪全握楽しみにしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2608278/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"typ